{"assets":["/statement-assets/cca8410dda2241664ed0368b34883610fd47bb63d3112158b03cf1758f5e1b3f.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1556","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Take a Guess"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/cca8410dda2241664ed0368b34883610fd47bb63d3112158b03cf1758f5e1b3f.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This is an interactive task"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"William has a certain sequence of integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ in his mind, but due to security concerns, he does not want to reveal it to you completely. William is ready to respond to no more than $$$2 \\cdot n$$$ of the following questions:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" What is the result of a "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#AND"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise AND"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" of two items with indices $$$i$$$ and $$$j$$$ ($$$i \\neq j$$$) "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" What is the result of a "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#OR"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise OR"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" of two items with indices $$$i$$$ and $$$j$$$ ($$$i \\neq j$$$) "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can ask William these questions and you need to find the $$$k$$$-th smallest number of the sequence."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Formally the $$$k$$$-th smallest number is equal to the number at the $$$k$$$-th place in a 1-indexed array sorted in non-decreasing order. For example in array $$$[5, 3, 3, 10, 1]$$$ $$$4$$$th smallest number is equal to $$$5$$$, and $$$2$$$nd and $$$3$$$rd are $$$3$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that for each element in a sequence the condition $$$0 \\le a_i \\le 10^9$$$ is satisfied."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"custom","title":"Interaction"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Interaction"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first line you will be given two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$ $$$(3 \\le n \\le 10^4, 1 \\le k \\le n)$$$, which are the number of items in the sequence $$$a$$$ and the number $$$k$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After that, you can ask no more than $$$2 \\cdot n$$$ questions (not including the \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"finish"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" operation)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each line of your output may be of one of the following types: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"or i j"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" $$$(1 \\le i, j \\le n, i \\neq j)$$$, where $$$i$$$ and $$$j$$$ are indices of items for which you want to calculate the bitwise "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"OR"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"and i j"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" $$$(1 \\le i, j \\le n, i \\neq j)$$$, where $$$i$$$ and $$$j$$$ are indices of items for which you want to calculate the bitwise "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"AND"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"finish res"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", where $$$res$$$ is the $$$k$$$th smallest number in the sequence. After outputting this line the program execution must conclude. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In response to the first two types of queries, you will get an integer $$$x$$$, the result of the operation for the numbers you have selected."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After outputting a line do not forget to output a new line character and flush the output buffer. Otherwise you will get the \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Idleness limit exceeded"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". To flush the buffer use:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"fflush(stdout)"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in C++ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"System.out.flush()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in Java "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"stdout.flush()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in Python "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"flush(output)"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in Pascal "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" for other languages refer to documentation "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If you perform an incorrect query the response will be $$$-1$$$. After receiving response $$$-1$$$ you must immediately halt your program in order to receive an \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Incorrect answer"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" verdict."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Hacking"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To perform a hack you will need to use the following format:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line must contain two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$ $$$(3 \\le n \\le 10^4, 1 \\le k \\le n)$$$, which are the number of items in the sequence $$$a$$$ and the number $$$k$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line must contain $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ $$$(0 \\le a_i \\le 10^9)$$$, the sequence $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7 6\n\n2\n\n7"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nand 2 5\n\nor 5 6\n\nfinish 5"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the example, the hidden sequence is $$$[1, 6, 4, 2, 3, 5, 4]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Below is the interaction in the example."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Query (contestant's program)"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Response (interactor)"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Notes"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"and 2 5"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$a_2=6$$$, $$$a_5=3$$$. Interactor returns bitwise AND of the given numbers."}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"or 5 6"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"7"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$a_5=3$$$, $$$a_6=5$$$. Interactor returns bitwise OR of the given numbers."}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"finish 5"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$5$$$ is the correct answer. Note that you must find the value and not the index of the kth smallest number."}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"}],"kind":"table_body"}],"kind":"table"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"1556D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1556/problem/D"}